00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:19,880
What's up, man?

861
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:21,130
(Jia Bing)

862
00:28:21,130 --> 00:28:22,080
Find anyone yet?

863
00:28:22,080 --> 00:28:23,500
Long time no see, Bing.

864
00:28:23,500 --> 00:28:24,960
What've you been up to this year?

865
00:28:25,290 --> 00:28:25,960
This year?

866
00:28:28,020 --> 00:28:29,260
(Braised ribs with oil noodles)

867
00:28:29,630 --> 00:28:30,460
Is this a menu?

868
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:32,170
I brought some new dishes.

869
00:28:32,170 --> 00:28:32,820
(Back with new dishes)

870
00:28:32,820 --> 00:28:34,360
Oh my gosh,

871
00:28:34,360 --> 00:28:35,080
Bing.

872
00:28:35,790 --> 00:28:37,960
Pig ears and chicken feet with soybeans.

873
00:28:37,960 --> 00:28:39,340
(Pig ears and chicken feet
with soybeans)

874
00:28:39,780 --> 00:28:41,620
Braised ribs with oil noodles!

875
00:28:41,630 --> 00:28:42,170
And this.

876
00:28:42,380 --> 00:28:44,540
Roasted pork belly with water celery.

877
00:28:46,500 --> 00:28:47,480
(So hungry he breaks into Peking opera)

878
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:48,390
(Successfully won them over with food)
You're hired.

879
00:28:48,390 --> 00:28:49,000
Teng, I'm making the call.

880
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:49,710
Hired on the spot.

881
00:28:49,710 --> 00:28:51,000
No interview needed.

882
00:28:51,500 --> 00:28:51,830
No interview.

883
00:28:51,830 --> 00:28:53,290
He never needs one anywhere.

884
00:28:53,630 --> 00:28:54,830
Let's all get together.

885
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:56,080
What've you been up to lately?

886
00:28:56,080 --> 00:28:57,670
Just working on some new dishes.

887
00:28:57,670 --> 00:28:59,170
It's been forever

888
00:28:59,170 --> 00:28:59,710
since I saw you.

889
00:28:59,710 --> 00:29:00,780
(Long time no see, bro)

890
00:29:02,860 --> 00:29:04,220
(When'd you learn grappling?)

891
00:29:04,290 --> 00:29:05,500
All seven of you can stay.

892
00:29:06,350 --> 00:29:07,860
♪All by myself♪

893
00:29:08,340 --> 00:29:09,850
♪With just one mouth♪

894
00:29:10,460 --> 00:29:12,830
Natural High Season 4.

895
00:29:13,250 --> 00:29:14,630
Natural High.

896
00:29:16,170 --> 00:29:16,710
What's that?

897
00:29:16,710 --> 00:29:18,080
Why are you doing four like that?

898
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:18,760
Four.

899
00:29:19,080 --> 00:29:19,500
Isn't it like this?

900
00:29:19,500 --> 00:29:20,000
It's like this.

901
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:21,750
What's wrong with mine?

902
00:29:23,330 --> 00:29:24,380
It has to be that exact way?

903
00:29:24,380 --> 00:29:26,080
I'm too used to drinking games.

904
00:29:26,790 --> 00:29:27,630
Keep the flag flying.

905
00:29:28,380 --> 00:29:28,790
Let's do it.

906
00:29:28,790 --> 00:29:29,100
Come on!

907
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:32,080
Natural High!

908
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:37,080
♪The most precious♪

909
00:29:40,250 --> 00:29:41,330
Let's take a walk by the beach.

910
00:29:41,830 --> 00:29:42,380
Let's go.

911
00:29:42,550 --> 00:29:43,070
Come on.

912
00:29:52,080 --> 00:29:52,670
This breeze...

913
00:29:53,040 --> 00:29:53,750
Feels so good.

914
00:30:00,250 --> 00:30:01,920
This view is gorgeous.

915
00:30:04,630 --> 00:30:06,000
Look how bright the moon is.

916
00:30:07,080 --> 00:30:08,330
It's like a giant spotlight.

917
00:30:08,330 --> 00:30:09,710
It's lighting up the whole ocean.

918
00:30:10,630 --> 00:30:11,710
The bright moon rises over the sea.

919
00:30:11,710 --> 00:30:12,790
We share this moment from afar.

920
00:30:13,330 --> 00:30:14,080
Bai was definitely

921
00:30:14,080 --> 00:30:15,750
pumping dumbbells in his room

922
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:17,170
just to wear this outfit.

923
00:30:17,630 --> 00:30:20,080
Bai was in there knitting this.

924
00:30:20,080 --> 00:30:22,460
(Fashion piece)
He just whipped it up.

925
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:25,670
This season,

926
00:30:25,670 --> 00:30:26,580
our old friend,

927
00:30:26,580 --> 00:30:27,290
the ultimate discovery expert,

928
00:30:27,540 --> 00:30:28,920
(Hello)
Taobao has brought us

929
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:30,290
a magical magnifying glass.

930
00:30:30,290 --> 00:30:31,000
Throughout the season,

931
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:32,380
we'll randomly get

932
00:30:32,380 --> 00:30:33,790
Taobao surprise gift boxes.

933
00:30:33,790 --> 00:30:34,880
They'll supersize the food

934
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:35,790
and supersize the fun.

935
00:30:35,790 --> 00:30:38,170
Let's supersize the fun together.

936
00:30:38,170 --> 00:30:39,170
Open Taobao and let's go.

937
00:30:41,330 --> 00:30:42,290
Before we eat,

938
00:30:42,290 --> 00:30:43,830
we've got a quick mission.

939
00:30:43,830 --> 00:30:45,040
Black Foot on the Beach.

940
00:30:45,880 --> 00:30:47,670
(Black Foot on the Beach)
Everyone has to put on flippers.

941
00:30:47,670 --> 00:30:48,630
(One of the eight is Black Foot)
Every player

942
00:30:48,630 --> 00:30:50,020
(Pop all balloons in 8 minutes)
will have a balloon tied to their foot.

943
00:30:50,020 --> 00:30:51,330
(To win)
Black Foot must

944
00:30:51,330 --> 00:30:52,290
pop everyone's balloon

945
00:30:52,290 --> 00:30:53,960
within eight minutes.

946
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:56,290
If the others survive for eight minutes,

947
00:30:56,290 --> 00:30:57,790
the good guys win.

948
00:30:58,740 --> 00:31:00,620
(Only Black Foot may open their eyes)
Okay.

949
00:31:00,670 --> 00:31:01,460
This round,

950
00:31:01,460 --> 00:31:03,380
the Taobao
magnifying-glass bonus is active.

951
00:31:03,380 --> 00:31:04,380
Find the

952
00:31:04,380 --> 00:31:05,250
magic magnifying glass on the beach.

953
00:31:06,040 --> 00:31:06,920
Found it!

954
00:31:06,940 --> 00:31:08,130
(Found it instantly)
Found it!

955
00:31:09,170 --> 00:31:10,500
Taobao's.

956
00:31:12,170 --> 00:31:13,790
Stop stealing my sponsor prop!

957
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:17,170
Hold it up and shout,
"Supersize the fun, boom!"

958
00:31:17,170 --> 00:31:18,330
Then you can choose someone

959
00:31:18,330 --> 00:31:19,380
and enlarge the balloon on their foot.

960
00:31:19,380 --> 00:31:20,290
After the game,

961
00:31:20,290 --> 00:31:21,250
you'll also get a Taobao

962
00:31:21,250 --> 00:31:22,290
seasonal skincare gift box.

963
00:31:22,290 --> 00:31:23,250
We'll start now.

964
00:31:24,040 --> 00:31:24,960
Any more?

965
00:31:25,710 --> 00:31:27,750
Can one person find more than one?

966
00:31:28,860 --> 00:31:30,700
(Combing the beach)

967
00:31:34,460 --> 00:31:35,290
Any more?

968
00:31:37,580 --> 00:31:38,790
I found another one!

969
00:31:38,790 --> 00:31:40,130
Supersize the fun, boom!

970
00:31:40,130 --> 00:31:42,170
Enlarge Wang Anyu's balloon.

971
00:31:43,580 --> 00:31:45,920
Then I'll enlarge Bing's.

972
00:31:46,080 --> 00:31:47,080
Enlarge!

973
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:47,960
Returning the favor.

974
00:31:50,060 --> 00:31:51,020
(What're you doing, bro?)

975
00:31:51,040 --> 00:31:52,670
(Suspicious)
Wait, is that even a balloon?

976
00:31:54,330 --> 00:31:55,420
Once you know which foot it's on,

977
00:31:55,420 --> 00:31:57,170
you can just keep that foot raised,

978
00:31:57,170 --> 00:31:57,750
right?

979
00:31:58,080 --> 00:31:58,750
Yeah.

980
00:31:58,750 --> 00:31:59,660
Right? Just keep it up.

981
00:31:59,660 --> 00:32:00,420
(Stay off the ground, stay safe)

982
00:32:00,420 --> 00:32:01,630
Okay, let's draw our roles.

983
00:32:02,380 --> 00:32:03,180
(Drawing roles)

984
00:32:08,900 --> 00:32:10,380
(Black Foot: Shen Teng)

985
00:32:10,380 --> 00:32:11,920
I've got a role in mind this round...

986
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:12,900
(Emergency role retraction)
Actually, a plan.

987
00:32:12,940 --> 00:32:14,710
(Something's very wrong here)
You've got a special role, Teng?

988
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:15,710
What role do I have?

989
00:32:16,790 --> 00:32:17,960
(Almost gave himself away)
Let's stick together.

990
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:18,540
Catch him.

991
00:32:18,540 --> 00:32:19,460
Then pop his balloon together.

992
00:32:19,460 --> 00:32:21,100
(Teng's plan: Group up and attack)

993
00:32:21,420 --> 00:32:22,000
No.

994
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:23,420
First, we need to figure out who it is.

995
00:32:23,420 --> 00:32:24,830
A few of us group up,

996
00:32:24,830 --> 00:32:25,920
start stomping like crazy,

997
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:28,130
and what if the wolf's off in a corner?

998
00:32:28,180 --> 00:32:30,340
(That's one idea)

999
00:32:30,500 --> 00:32:32,330
Once the lights go out,

1000
00:32:32,330 --> 00:32:33,170
let's group up first.

1001
00:32:33,330 --> 00:32:33,750
Okay.

1002
00:32:34,250 --> 00:32:36,290
(Exactly what I wanted)
We'll call names and answer.

1003
00:32:36,330 --> 00:32:37,630
Whoever's missing, we go find them.

1004
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:39,670
Okay.

1005
00:32:40,290 --> 00:32:40,670
Let's do it.

1006
00:32:41,460 --> 00:32:42,420
Let's go!

1007
00:32:44,170 --> 00:32:44,500
Wait.

1008
00:32:44,500 --> 00:32:45,130
If we group up,

1009
00:32:45,130 --> 00:32:46,670
won't the wolf group up too?

1010
00:32:46,670 --> 00:32:47,660
(Tiny lightbulb moment)

1011
00:32:47,780 --> 00:32:49,540
(Plan exposed)

1012
00:32:49,540 --> 00:32:51,580
But at least we'll know

1013
00:32:51,580 --> 00:32:53,040
(There you go again)
who popped our balloons.

1014
00:32:53,100 --> 00:32:54,080
(Very reassuring)
Right.

1015
00:32:54,080 --> 00:32:54,920
Once he pops one,

1016
00:32:54,920 --> 00:32:56,540
he might not get away.

1017
00:32:56,620 --> 00:32:59,100
(The general's still
the same old general)

1018
00:32:59,250 --> 00:32:59,630
Let's go.

1019
00:32:59,630 --> 00:33:00,140
(Who's Black Foot?)

1020
00:33:00,140 --> 00:33:01,380
(Black Foot: Shen Teng)

1021
00:33:01,380 --> 00:33:02,380
Oh my gosh.

1022
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:07,880
I wanna copy Bai

1023
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:08,960
and give concert vibes.

1024
00:33:10,260 --> 00:33:10,940
♪Superhero♪

1025
00:33:11,180 --> 00:33:11,870
♪Keep it real♪

1026
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:15,130
Who dumped sand all over me?

1027
00:33:16,210 --> 00:33:17,420
Someone's already making a move,

1028
00:33:17,420 --> 00:33:18,130
guys.

1029
00:33:18,260 --> 00:33:19,500
(Who's pretending to be me?)

1030
00:33:19,500 --> 00:33:20,330
(Black Foot: Shen Teng)
Let's group up first,

1031
00:33:20,330 --> 00:33:20,710
guys.

1032
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:22,000
Where are we grouping up?

1033
00:33:22,420 --> 00:33:23,500
Over by you guys?

1034
00:33:23,830 --> 00:33:25,500
Let's meet in the middle.

1035
00:33:25,860 --> 00:33:27,670
(Good guys assembling)

1036
00:33:27,670 --> 00:33:28,170
Come on!

1037
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:29,380
Come on!

1038
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:30,880
Who's on my right?

1039
00:33:30,890 --> 00:33:31,440
Me.

1040
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:31,880
Hu.

1041
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:33,000
Hu, Wang.

1042
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:33,710
On my left...

1043
00:33:34,540 --> 00:33:35,580
There's no one on my left.

1044
00:33:36,060 --> 00:33:39,060
(Black Foot waits for his chance)

1045
00:33:40,460 --> 00:33:41,670
Bai's arm.

1046
00:33:41,670 --> 00:33:43,170
I'm holding Bai's hand.

1047
00:33:43,170 --> 00:33:43,960
You're holding Bai's hand?

1048
00:33:43,960 --> 00:33:44,880
I'm coming.

1049
00:33:44,880 --> 00:33:46,250
Where are you?

1050
00:33:46,250 --> 00:33:46,670
Okay.

1051
00:33:46,670 --> 00:33:47,250
I'm coming.

1052
00:33:47,250 --> 00:33:47,510
No.

1053
00:33:48,630 --> 00:33:50,080
- I still don't have anyone here.
- Where's Bing?

1054
00:33:50,100 --> 00:33:53,020
(Grab)

1055
00:33:53,080 --> 00:33:54,040
I'm here.

1056
00:33:54,040 --> 00:33:54,580
Bing!

1057
00:33:54,580 --> 00:33:56,070
Here.

1058
00:33:56,630 --> 00:33:57,750
Bing's over here with me.

1059
00:33:57,750 --> 00:33:58,170
Yeah.

1060
00:33:58,170 --> 00:34:00,740
(Good guys assembled)

1061
00:34:03,460 --> 00:34:04,170
Where's Jingyu?

1062
00:34:05,630 --> 00:34:06,250
Jingyu?

1063
00:34:06,250 --> 00:34:06,710
Jingyu!

1064
00:34:07,140 --> 00:34:09,699
(Quietly sneaking off to the side)

1065
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:13,290
Mr. Huang.

1066
00:34:13,540 --> 00:34:14,000
We're done for.

1067
00:34:14,739 --> 00:34:15,680
(Suspected for being too quiet)
I'm on the outside.

1068
00:34:15,680 --> 00:34:16,500
I'm not the wolf.

1069
00:34:17,940 --> 00:34:20,179
(Black Foot attacks)

1070
00:34:24,380 --> 00:34:26,540
The sound came from over here!

1071
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:27,880
Who stepped on me?

1072
00:34:27,880 --> 00:34:28,580
(Black Foot: Shen Teng)
Was it me?

1073
00:34:28,580 --> 00:34:29,130
(Still keeping up the act)

1074
00:34:29,130 --> 00:34:29,710
Was it me?

1075
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:30,540
No.

1076
00:34:30,540 --> 00:34:31,880
Mine popped!

1077
00:34:31,880 --> 00:34:33,460
(Hu Xianxu out)
Bai's definitely innocent!

1078
00:34:33,460 --> 00:34:34,290
Hu's popped!

1079
00:34:34,460 --> 00:34:35,500
(Death grip)

1080
00:34:35,520 --> 00:34:36,120
Wang!

1081
00:34:36,540 --> 00:34:37,880
(All alone)
I'm okay!

1082
00:34:38,330 --> 00:34:39,460
Stay together!

1083
00:34:39,790 --> 00:34:40,250
Don't split up!

1084
00:34:42,330 --> 00:34:43,250
Keep moving.

1085
00:34:43,250 --> 00:34:44,960
Keep your balloon foot moving!

1086
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:46,630
Don't panic!

1087
00:34:46,630 --> 00:34:48,940
(Keeping it off the ground)

1088
00:34:48,980 --> 00:34:52,500
(Center of gravity)

1089
00:34:55,620 --> 00:34:58,020
(Searching for a target)

1090
00:34:58,060 --> 00:35:00,340
(Still all alone)

1091
00:35:02,690 --> 00:35:03,130
Who?

1092
00:35:03,130 --> 00:35:03,720
Who is it?

1093
00:35:03,720 --> 00:35:04,420
(Miss)
Who?

1094
00:35:06,940 --> 00:35:08,300
(Rushing around)

1095
00:35:08,300 --> 00:35:09,860
(Scrambling on all fours)

1096
00:35:10,140 --> 00:35:10,490
Who?

1097
00:35:10,750 --> 00:35:11,460
Over here!

1098
00:35:11,470 --> 00:35:11,720
Who?

1099
00:35:12,080 --> 00:35:12,600
Who?

1100
00:35:13,240 --> 00:35:13,760
Who?

1101
00:35:13,760 --> 00:35:14,240
Bai!

1102
00:35:15,060 --> 00:35:15,640
(Chain reaction in progress)

1103
00:35:15,640 --> 00:35:16,120
Who's this?

1104
00:35:19,180 --> 00:35:19,740
(Perfect chance to attack)

1105
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:20,240
Who?

1106
00:35:20,240 --> 00:35:20,680
Who's this?

1107
00:35:20,680 --> 00:35:21,040
Who?

1108
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:21,920
Who's this?

1109
00:35:22,540 --> 00:35:23,540
(Pants up and charging)

1110
00:35:23,720 --> 00:35:24,480
Who's this?

1111
00:35:25,940 --> 00:35:27,820
(Target locked)

1112
00:35:33,700 --> 00:35:34,300
(Miss)

1113
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:36,880
Who?

1114
00:35:37,200 --> 00:35:37,600
Who?

1115
00:35:39,540 --> 00:35:41,340
(You'd never guess who)

1116
00:35:41,380 --> 00:35:44,180
(Next target)

1117
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:45,920
It's Shen.

1118
00:35:46,600 --> 00:35:47,440
It's Shen!

1119
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:47,960
Teng?

1120
00:35:48,140 --> 00:35:49,380
(He's that agile?)

1121
00:35:50,720 --> 00:35:51,960
Who? Jingyu hasn't said anything.

1122
00:35:51,960 --> 00:35:52,560
I'm here.

1123
00:35:52,620 --> 00:35:54,860
(Randomly blaming the quiet one)

1124
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:55,960
I've got him!

1125
00:35:56,600 --> 00:35:57,360
I've got him!

1126
00:35:57,360 --> 00:35:57,920
Shen!

1127
00:35:58,680 --> 00:35:59,240
Shen!

1128
00:35:59,240 --> 00:35:59,800
Who?

1129
00:35:59,940 --> 00:36:02,780
(Retreat!)

1130
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:04,360
Shen!

1131
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:05,080
(He ran?)

1132
00:36:05,080 --> 00:36:06,600
It's him!

1133
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:07,880
Step on him!

1134
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:09,760
Step on him!

1135
00:36:10,480 --> 00:36:11,200
Don't step on me!

1136
00:36:11,200 --> 00:36:11,600
Where is he?

1137
00:36:12,280 --> 00:36:12,720
Step on him!

1138
00:36:14,080 --> 00:36:14,600
Where is he?

1139
00:36:15,240 --> 00:36:15,720
Step on him!

1140
00:36:18,160 --> 00:36:19,400
Shen! Who's this?

1141
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:20,080
It's me!

1142
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:21,700
(Blatant frame-up)
Definitely Fan Chengcheng.

1143
00:36:21,820 --> 00:36:22,980
